5G full-link prediction technology:\nNetworks can now be optimized networks for calls and live-streaming.\n[Xiaomi HyperConnect]\nUpgraded cross-device connectivity framework.\nUpgraded Home screen+:\nYou can drag phone apps onto Xiaomi tablets or add them as native apps.\nUpdated cross-device camera:\nThe upgraded cross-device camera allows you to use two cameras simultaneously for multi-angle live streaming.\nUpdated shared clipboard:\nShared clipboard allows you to batch copy text for easier multi-device sharing.\nSmart home devices:\nSmart home upgrades improve the consistency of control experience of various terminal devices, covering Xiaomi Smart Hub"}]}